{%- comment -%}
  STUDENTS HERO — the Students page's hero (Assets/Lava/Partials/
  VideoHero.lava, Styles/_video-hero.scss), as the other ministry pages', in
  the homepage VRL Students section's colours (heroTheme 'students': the
  charcoal gradient and film grain).

  Block:                    an HTML block in the Students page's Feature zone
  Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/StudentsHero.lava' %}
  Enabled Lava Commands:    none
  Page:                     InnerDefault, PageHeaderStyle Hidden, DarkHeader
                            checked

  The lead line under "VRL Students" is the page's Description (Page
  Properties). The button jumps to the first weekly night (MSM) on this page.
  No video yet: a labelled green placeholder stands in. When the video is in
  Rock, delete heroPlaceholder and set heroMediaId to its media element id.

  The page content under it: Assets/Lava/Students.lava (Main zone).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign heroTheme = 'students' -%}
{%- assign heroTitle = 'VRL Students' -%}
{%- assign heroKicker = 'Middle school & high school' -%}
{%- assign heroPlaceholder = 'Video: VRL Students' -%}
{%- capture heroActions -%}
  <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#msm">Find your night</a>
{%- endcapture -%}
{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava' %}
